    {
      "ja": "• 『機動戦士ガンダム外伝 THE BLUE DESTINY』に登場する主人公機“蒼い死神”ブルーディスティニー1号機が新たにHGで登場！",
      "en": "• The main character “Blue Reaper” Blue Destiny Unit 1 from “Mobile Suit Gundam Gaiden THE BLUE DESTINY” is now available in HG!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ゲーム版のほか、「月刊ガンダムエース」で連載中の『ザ・ブルー・ディスティニー』版を再現できる頭部も付属。どちらもEXAMシステム起動中のメインカメラは選択式で再現できる。",
      "en": "• In addition to the game version, a head that can reproduce the version of ``The Blue Destiny'' currently being serialized in ``Gundam Ace'' is also included. In both cases, the main camera while the EXAM system is activated can be selectively reproduced."
    },
    {
